# First Alliance horse from Katie Hunter (Eastvale Logging Camp).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: one Riding skill (Apprentice 75 from level 40, Journeyman 150
# at 60). Training costs 100g and 1,000g (Forever's world data: the trainers of
# Velma Warnam and Genn Fairweather, build 70124) and comes with a mount
# (Blizzard). ItemSparse lists the mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60)
# for every race of the faction, but each one also needs Horse Riding (824;
# MountCapability), which SkillLineAbility gives only Humans with Riding: the
# faction's other races and the Skyborne must learn it.
# ASSUMED: Randal Hunter teaches it to them at Exalted with Stormwind (Classic
# rule; a beta player guide says other races' mounts need Exalted). In-game
# check: a Dwarf at Randal Hunter, with and without Exalted.
# ASSUMED: Honored with your race's home city takes 10% off training and mounts
# (beta player guides; Classic had the same). In-game check: the price at Honored.
# Black Stallion Bridle: the world data's vendor rows list it only at Unger
# Statforth (Menethil Harbor), and a beta player guide found it only there.

step Learn to ride
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Randal Hunter and Katie Hunter's horse pen are at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest. At 40 Randal Hunter teaches Riding to Humans for 100g (10% less at Honored with Stormwind), and it comes with a horse. Other races learn Riding, with their own first mount, at their own race's riding trainer.
  level 40
  train 4732 only Human               -- Randal Hunter, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Horse Riding for other races
  only Dwarf,NightElf,Gnome,Skyborne
  when !knows 824
  tip Any Alliance race can buy these horses, but riding one also takes Horse Riding, which only Humans get with Riding. Randal Hunter teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with Stormwind (the Stormwind Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a horse for this character.
  rep "Stormwind" Exalted
  train 4732                          -- Randal Hunter, Horse Riding

step Pick a colour
  tip Katie Hunter sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 384                          -- Katie Hunter
  buy 2414 npc 384 optional           -- Pinto Bridle, 20g
  buy 5655 npc 384 optional           -- Chestnut Mare Bridle, 20g
  buy 5656 npc 384 optional           -- Brown Horse Bridle, 20g

step Black Stallion in Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  tip The Black Stallion is not at Katie Hunter: Unger Statforth sells it, at the stables of Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands (20g in the Forever client). Skip this unless you want that colour.
  buy 2411 npc 1460 optional          -- Black Stallion Bridle, 20g, Unger Statforth
